Any commercial use of the software requires prior written permission from Jimi Goldstein. This includes using the software to provide paid analyses or consulting, incorporating it into a commercial product or service, and using it to develop or validate a product for sale. This requirement applies even if the software itself is supplied free of charge. Jimi Goldstein may grant permission for rights he owns or is authorised to license.

