This licence applies to the original project software in a distribution that includes or expressly adopts it. Third-party software, databases and other materials retain their own licences and attribution notices. Copies already supplied under an earlier licence retain the permissions granted with those copies. The copyright holders reserve all rights beyond those expressly granted here.

